# The storefront needs NO environment variables. It reads its catalog from
# /api/catalog (Cloudflare KV, synced from Loyverse by the Worker).
#
# The Loyverse access token is NOT set here. It lives in Cloudflare's Secrets
# Store as `AFPWebsite` and is bound to the Worker in wrangler.jsonc.
# Never put it in this file, in client code, or behind a VITE_ prefix.
